    "path": "Sub-content/Content/Image"
   },
   {
    "text": "We test what material systems, urban infrastructures, and territories could become through systems-based approaches, prototyping, speculation, and visualization. Our work is funded through federal, institutional, and industry partners. We collaborate with planners, landscape architects, scientists, engineers, archaeologists, industry, and other labs nationally and globally.",
