 "/team": {
  "seo": {
   "title": "Team | RVTR",
   "description": "Kathy Velikov, FAIA, and Geoffrey Thün direct RVTR at Taubman College, University of Michigan, with research associates and alumni."
  },
  "desktop": [
   {
    "text": "Team",
    "layer": "Kicker rv-intro",
    "path": "Top Section/Content/Title Container"
   },
   {
    "text": "An experimental platform for architecture and urban design research.",
    "layer": "Title rv-intro rv-d1",
    "path": "Top Section/Content/Title Container"
   },
   {
    "text": "RVTR’s work operates across scales to position design as an active agent in continually evolving ecologies: biotic, social, environmental, technological and cultural. Projects range from the urban futures of regional territories, to high-performance building design, to prototype-based research in responsive envelope systems and digitally crafted objects. A complex systems approach ties these scales together, along with a belief in the power of design to change the world for the better.",
    "layer": "Content",
    "path": "Desktop/Main/Introducing"
   },
   {
    "alt": "Kathy Velikov and Geoffrey Thün in the Stubai Alps",
    "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/YOY8hUC04XjNbuQFtFmmN42pQ0Y.jpg",
    "layer": "",
    "path": "Desktop/Main/Directors photo"
   },
   {
    "text": "About",
    "layer": "Text",
    "path": "Our History/Title Container/Label"
   },
   {
    "text": "Since 2007 the directors have brought design research into practice, to advance both professional and disciplinary discourse and the depth of thinking in the work. The lab operates as an experimental think tank with national funding agencies, philanthropic foundations and industry partners, and works with multidisciplinary teams of academic, scientific and industry partners and professional consultants.",
    "layer": "Title",
    "path": "Main/Our History/Title Container"
   },
   {
    "alt": "Resonant Chamber, RVTR",
    "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/bsyoNvsH4GZTzdspfDHlmFScvA.jpg",
    "layer": "Image",
    "path": "Our History/Description/Image"
   },
   {
    "alt": "North House, RVTR",
    "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/EqZ0gF3OWgiI5tFUUcbFIjLroU.jpg",
    "layer": "Image",
    "path": "Description/Container/Image"
   },
   {
    "text": "The lab’s work has received the Architectural League Prize for Young Architects + Designers (2008) and Architect magazine R+D Awards in 2010 and 2016. In 2016 RVTR represented Canada at the Venice Architecture Biennale as part of EXTRACTION, led by curator Pierre Bélanger.",
